Ongoing responsibility areas (career, health, finances, family). Unlike projects, they have no defined end.

Recommended: scope of each area, maintenance goals, monitoring metrics. I suggest using MOCs (Methods of Career, Health, Finances, Family, and Competency).
Should not include: initiatives with a defined start and end. It is best to have them in "Projects".

It's your life, create your own criteria and responsibilities for this folder.
